===Use the energy hub and activate the gear bridge terminal{{subst:void|<!--101110204-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Silvermane Guard Restricted Zone|update|Your encounter with Dunn turns out to be easy indeed: You knock the dignified Silvermane Captain out cold and acquire the encryption key that unlocks the gate to the energy hub.<br />You open up the path to the energy hub. Now it's time for Serval, the expert mechanic, to do her thing.}}
