===Go to the restricted zone's frontline{{subst:void|<!--101110207-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Silvermane Guard Restricted Zone|update|In the midst of the deep shifting sounds of the mechanical structure, the rotating Gear Bridge is now positioned in its designated position. The frontlines of fighting against the Fragmentum are but a bridge away.<br />On the other side of the bridge lies nothing but a boundless Fragmentum &mdash; countless warriors have fought in this brutal place until they've lost complete control over their bodies.<br />And now, the bravest warriors of them all have turned and changed sides. They are welcoming your challenge.}}
